   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "I was wondering if anyone has had the following error message when running gl.pcoa.plot after successfully running gl.pcoa on a gl object? <div><br><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"color:blue;white-space:pre\">&gt; </span><span style=\"color:blue\">gl.pcoa.plot(pc, gl_SF_final2, labels=&quot;pop&quot;, xaxis=1, yaxis=2)\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error in gl.pcoa.plot(pc, gl_SF_final2, labels = &quot;pop&quot;, xaxis = 1, yaxis = 2) : \r\n  unused argument (labels = &quot;pop&quot;)</span></span></span><br></div><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,0.87);font-family:Roboto,RobotoDraft,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:normal\">Can the gl.pcoa.plot function not find the pop factor in gl_SF_final2? This used to work fine before a recent upgrade of R and RStudio but would rather not go back to older versions. </span></span></span></div><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,0.87);font-family:Roboto,RobotoDraft,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:normal\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,0.87);font-family:Roboto,RobotoDraft,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:normal\">Thanks for any thoughts.</span>\r\n\r\n</span></span></div></div>"
